# LLVIP Dataset Path
# Set this to the root directory of your locally downloaded LLVIP dataset.
# The project expects this structure:
#   LLVIP/
#   ├── visible/
#   │   ├── train/
#   │   └── test/
#   ├── infrared/
#   │   ├── train/
#   │   └── test/
#   └── Annotations/
#
# Example:
#   Windows: C:/Users/yourname/datasets/LLVIP
#   Linux:   /home/yourname/datasets/LLVIP
#   macOS:   /Users/yourname/datasets/LLVIP
LLVIP_DATASET_ROOT=/path/to/LLVIP
